          "relation": "states",
          "snippet": {
            "line": 173,
            "text": "theorem torusAverage_pressureSource {a b : ℝ} (hab : a < b) {f : Lift S → ℝ}\n    (hf : ContDiff ℝ ∞ f) (p : ℝ × S) :\n    torusAverage (pressureSource a b hab f) p =\n      torusAverage f p - rho a b hab p.1 * pressureMass f p.2"
          }
